<title>GERMANY: TABLE-GERMAN JULY WHOLESALE PRICES FALL ONE PCT.</title>
<headline>TABLE-GERMAN JULY WHOLESALE PRICES FALL ONE PCT.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p>  GERMAN WHOLESALE PRICES    July 97    June 97    July 96</p>
<p>  Monthly change		  -1.0	 -0.3	 -0.5</p>
<p>  Yearly change		   +2.0	 +2.6	 -0.5</p>
<p>  Index (basis 1991)	    105.6	106.7	103.5</p>
<p>NOTE - The Federal Statistics Office said the drop in prices from June to July was driven by 12-percent declines in prices of pork and raw coffee, an 11-percent fall in fresh vegetables and a 7.4-percent drop in meat. Moderate increases came in coffee and coffee extract, light heating oil and wurst prices.</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, +49-228 26097150</p>
</text>
